<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In Appendix A Experimental Setup and Reproducibility ‣ Draft, Verify, &amp; Improve Toward Training-Aware Speculative Decoding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Reproducibility</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
